Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 08:24:07 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 409/417] Translations (ja): the Draft tray's title; Draft's
 and Tux's compiled translations

A sweep of every menu, toolbar and preference text in Japanese found one
English title outside the names that stay English (fonts, languages,
licences, standards, keys): the Draft tray, titled from its object name.
Draft and Tux keep their .qm in the sources: compiled again, so that
the strings translated before show too.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
